flowchart TB
  subgraph future[Future owner-approved provider edge]
    P[Provider delivery\nfor example Zernio Meta lead event]
  end

  subgraph hon[HON private school-scoped boundary]
    V[Bounded raw-body\nverification]
    R[Immutable inbound receipt\nprovider event ID + digest]
    M[Pinned connection, mapping,\nschema and policy versions]
    Q[Human Integration Review case]
    D[Qualified human\nclosed decision]
    C[Separate normal CRM command\ncreate distinct lead only]
    A[Audit + internal-only\noutbox evidence]
    X[Quarantine / dead letter /\nreconciliation case]
  end

  P --> V
  V -->|valid signed and mapped| R
  V -->|invalid, unsupported, or unknown| X
  R -->|same identity + same digest| R
  R -->|same identity + different digest| X
  R --> M --> Q --> D
  Q -->|stale mapping, drift, or unknown outcome| X
  D -->|CREATE_DISTINCT_NEW_LEAD after rechecks| C --> A
  D -->|skip, reject, insufficient evidence, or escalate| A

  classDef future fill:#fff5e6,stroke:#a35b00,color:#3d2600
  classDef protected fill:#eaf7ff,stroke:#126782,color:#082a39
  classDef exception fill:#fff0f1,stroke:#a51c30,color:#4a0610
  class P future
  class V,R,M,Q,D,C,A protected
  class X exception
